            <ArticleTitle>Opioids for the management of persistent non-cancer pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>24-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Persistent non-cancer pain is a serious problem. This article outlines issues in the management of patients with severe pain who are using strong opioids. These analgesics can provide analgesia and improve quality of life without a need for an escalating dose.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
